{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1524229-character-creation-questions","id":1524229,"title":"Character Creation Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-10-18T12:24:31-07:00","id":1524229,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Character Creation Questions","content":"In Werewolf the Apocalypse Fifth Edition, the only place that I can find that mentions how many points of Advantages / Flaws you can (should? must?) take is in the character creation summary. Are all characters required to take the full 7 points of Advantages and the full 2 points of Flaws? If so, given how few flaws there are, aren't characters all going to have very similar flaws?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6326,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6326-krelios","user":"krelios","date":".  Clarifying that this is for WtA 5e 10-18-2023, 05:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6326-krelios","name":"krelios","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6326_1.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-18T13:28:13-07:00","id":1524236,"title":"","content":"Are you talking about Merits and Flaws? It sounds like it, but what you say does not exactly match up to the rules. In W20, the details of obtaining Merits and Flaws during character creation are covered on the first page of the Appendix, page 471.<br /> <br /> Merits and Flaws are optional, and you spend your Freebies to purchase Merits. If you select Flaws, that is the number of Freebie points you gain. You take them only if you want them (and your ST approves). Many PCs don't have any Merits or Flaws. <br /> <br /> You can purchase as many Merits as you like provided you have the Freebie points. However, you can only receive up to 7 freebie points by taking Flaws.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-18T13:49:15-07:00","id":1524238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1524229-character-creation-questions?p=1524236#post1524236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you talking about Merits and Flaws?</div> </div> </div> </div>I honestly thought it was a 5th edition question. I feel like we need some sort of guidelines for people to specify which version they are asking about (if not a completely separate 5E board, given how it sometimes feels they are not really even trying to be the same games anymore). \ud83e\udee4","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-18T14:24:02-07:00","id":1524240,"title":"","content":"It was a 5e question, yes. My apologies for not clarifying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6326-krelios","name":"krelios","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6326_1.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-19T19:52:23-07:00","id":1524301,"title":"","content":"Your better off asking on the official World of Darkness Discord. That's where W5 folks are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-22T04:24:43-07:00","id":1524384,"title":"","content":"My personal recommendation would be that if nothing else appeals, you take the inverse of the Allies Background as a Flaw. Not the weird &quot;Stalker&quot;-Flaw from pg 101 but instead the dots you put into it represent an individual who has some sort of rivalry or beef with the PC. So two dots would be &quot;average individual or tight-knit group of weak individuals&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}